{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18947","headline":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌二首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤翣拥铭旌，威迟异吉行。\n汉仪陈秘器，楚挽咽繁声。\n驻綍辞清庙，凝笳背直城。\n唯应留内传，知是向蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}